      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The slides describe community peace pledges, the reeve and shire reeve, royal administration, local courts and travelling justiciars. Their organising theme is the movement from local custom toward institutions able to hear disputes across territories.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "83e63af86527c461e899099a2f48de3efedc3e480521ef210010a1c1922e6792",
              "sha256": "48c98de26d06ad13cd76c3d8d1df74f93e2208b0d5dd1597bb5575580a0b1370",
              "page": 4
            },
            {
              "id": "83e63af86527c461e899099a2f48de3efedc3e480521ef210010a1c1922e6792",
              "sha256": "48c98de26d06ad13cd76c3d8d1df74f93e2208b0d5dd1597bb5575580a0b1370",
              "page": 5
            },
            {
              "id": "83e63af86527c461e899099a2f48de3efedc3e480521ef210010a1c1922e6792",
              "sha256": "48c98de26d06ad13cd76c3d8d1df74f93e2208b0d5dd1597bb5575580a0b1370",
              "page": 8
            },
            {
              "id": "83e63af86527c461e899099a2f48de3efedc3e480521ef210010a1c1922e6792",
              "sha256": "48c98de26d06ad13cd76c3d8d1df74f93e2208b0d5dd1597bb5575580a0b1370",
              "page": 10
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "In the presentation’s account, travelling judges encounter repeated disputes. Similar treatment over time helps explain how precedent can produce a body of law common across places. The homework asks you to connect this institutional development to today’s terms.",
          "source_refs": [
            {
              "id": "83e63af86527c461e899099a2f48de3efedc3e480521ef210010a1c1922e6792",
              "sha256": "48c98de26d06ad13cd76c3d8d1df74f93e2208b0d5dd1597bb5575580a0b1370",
              "page": 4
            },
            {
              "id": "83e63af86527c461e899099a2f48de3efedc3e480521ef210010a1c1922e6792",
              "sha256": "48c98de26d06ad13cd76c3d8d1df74f93e2208b0d5dd1597bb5575580a0b1370",
              "page": 5
